<section id="brand-story">
  <div class="container reveal">
    <div class="story-grid">
      <div class="ph light">
        <img src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="CARPE brand story" style="object-position:center 8%;">
      </div>
      <div class="story-text">
        <span class="section-label">Our Story</span>
        <h2 class="section-title" style="margin-bottom:22px;">Seize the Moment.</h2>
        <p>CARPE was built on a simple idea — that everyday clothing should carry the same confidence as a statement piece. No noise, no excess. Just precise cuts, heavyweight fabrics, and a monochrome foundation built to last beyond the season.</p>
        <p>Every drop is produced in limited runs, designed for people who move with intention and dress like it matters.</p>
        <div class="story-stats">
          <div><div class="num">2021</div><div class="lbl">Founded</div></div>
          <div><div class="num">40K+</div><div class="lbl">Members</div></div>
          <div><div class="num">18</div><div class="lbl">Drops Released</div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

